        "original_id": "7d90cb5d-c685-5961-a5cb-ffb1851e0076",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christian Rivers, Philip Reeve, Peter Jackson\n- Works: Mortal Engines, The Dam Busters, King Kong\n- Roles: director, storyboard artist, visual effects supervisor, special effects technician, cameo actor\n\nFacts:\n- Philip Reeve wrote the novel \"Mortal Engines\", and the film \"Mortal Engines\" is based on that novel.\n- Christian Rivers is a New Zealand storyboard artist, visual effects supervisor, special effects technician, and director.\n- Christian Rivers cameoed as a Gondorian soldier and as a Soldier in Truck in \"King Kong\".\n- Christian Rivers was set to direct the adaptation of \"Mortal Engines\" and the remake of \"The Dam Busters\", and Peter Jackson was producing both films.",
